                            <p><span class="font-bold">For non-material changes</span> (such as clarifications, formatting, or minor wording adjustments), we will update the "Last updated" date at the top. Continued use of the App after such updates are published constitutes your acceptance of the changes.</p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section id="section-18" class="scroll-mt-32">
                        <h2 class="text-[20px] md:text-[24px] font-bold mb-5 text-[#090924]">18. Contact</h2>
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-[16px] text-[#090924] opacity-80 leading-relaxed">
                            <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:</p>
                            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:legal@statch.io" class="text-[#2054E1] hover:underline font-semibold">legal@statch.io</a></p>
